---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Game Client" description="SpaceAge Game Client - Download and Installation">
  <section class="client-content">
	<h1>Game Client</h1>

	<div class="intro-card card">
	  <h2>Visual Tools & Report Client</h2>
	  <p>
		To play SpaceAge, you need a way to read quarterly reports, analyze your faction's status, and draft orders.
		This page links to the visual tool client application that handles all of this.
	  </p>
	</div>

	<section class="features-section">
	  <h2>What You Can Do</h2>
	  <div class="features">
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>📊 Read Reports</h3>
		  <p>View your quarterly game reports in an organized, visual interface. Navigate units, facilities, and research status at a glance.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>⭐ Explore the Galaxy</h3>
		  <p>Interactive star map showing systems, gates, your colonies, and known contacts. Zoom in on specific regions or view the whole galaxy.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>✏️ Draft Orders</h3>
		  <p>Build orders with a point-and-click interface. Validation and error checking help you avoid mistakes before submission.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>⚔️ Battle Simulator</h3>
		  <p>Test what-if scenarios: what happens if you engage that enemy fleet? The simulator models combat before you commit.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>🛸 Transit Calculator</h3>
		  <p>Calculate travel times between systems. Account for ship mass, drive speed, and distance—essential for planning movements.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="feature-item">
		  <h3>📋 Rules Reference</h3>
		  <p>Full rules and technology catalog integrated into the client. Look up details without leaving the application.</p>
		</div>
	  </div>
	</section>

	<section class="placeholder-section card">
	  <h2>Coming Soon</h2>
	  <p>
		The visual tool client is currently in development. Full details, download links, and installation instructions
		will be available here during the campaign. Check back soon!
	  </p>
	  <div class="placeholder-visual">
		<p style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🔧 Client Placeholder</p>
		<p>Visual Tool Launch: Phase 3</p>
	  </div>
	</section>

	<section class="getting-started card">
	  <h2>Getting Started</h2>
	  <ol>
		<li>Download the Game Client (link will appear here)</li>
		<li>Open your current quarterly report with the client</li>
		<li>Review your faction's status, resources, and military units</li>
		<li>Plan your strategy using the star map and simulator</li>
		<li>Draft and submit your orders before the deadline</li>
	  </ol>
	  <p>
		<strong>New to the rules?</strong> Read the <a href="/rules">Rules Overview</a> first to understand core concepts.
	  </p>
	</section>

	<section class="support-section">
	  <h2>Questions?</h2>
	  <p>
		Check the <a href="/rules">full rules</a> or browse the <a href="/">home page</a> for more information about SpaceAge.
	  </p>
	</section>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .client-content {
	max-width: 900px;
	margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
	color: var(--color-accent-teal);
	margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .intro-card {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .features-section {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .features {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
	gap: var(--space-lg);
	margin-top: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .feature-item {
	background-color: var(--color-card-bg);
	color: var(--color-text-dark);
	padding: var(--space-lg);
	border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .feature-item h3 {
	color: var(--color-accent-teal);
	margin-top: 0;
  }

  .placeholder-section {
	text-align: center;
	background-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.05);
	border: 1px dashed var(--color-accent-teal);
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .placeholder-visual {
	background-color: rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.1);
	border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-teal);
	border-radius: var(--radius-md);
	padding: var(--space-2xl);
	margin-top: var(--space-lg);
	color: #666;
  }

  .getting-started {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .getting-started ol {
	margin-left: var(--space-lg);
	color: var(--color-text-dark);
  }

  .getting-started li {
	margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
	line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .support-section {
	text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
	.features {
	  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
	}
  }
</style>
